{"title": "[外絮] 老巴:今年76人是東區爭冠隊我的第一選擇", "author": "pneumo (老巴在台發言人)", "board": "", "date": "Thu Oct 22 23:01:04 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1792681267.A.243.html", "body": "來源：Heavy\n網址：\nhttps://tinyurl.com/38h67fp6\n\nDuring the first episode of “Inside the NBA” of the year on Wednesday\nnight, NBA legend Charles Barkley made a strong statement about the 76ers,\ndeclaring that he believes they’re the clear favorite in the Eastern\nConference.\n\n在今天\"Inside the NBA\"本季首播時，老巴做了個鄭重地宣告，他認為76人會是東區\n\n的熱門隊伍。他說：\n\n“Contenders… Philly is the number one pick in the East in my opinion. And\nthen, there’s six other teams,” Barkley said.\n\n「爭冠球隊...我的意見是，76人會是東區首選。」\n\n「然後還有其他六隊。」\n\nBarkley also spoke with NBC Sports Philadelphia’s “Unfiltered” on\nWednesday afternoon and explained why he believes Maxey and Brown are the\ncornerstones of the 76ers.\n\n而在另外一個節目上，老巴解釋了為什麼Maxey跟杰倫是76人的基石球員。他說：\n\n“The two best players on the team are Maxey and Jaylen Brown. LeBron he’s\ngoing to be a facilitator. But those two guys are going to be the reason that\nthe Sixers win a championship,” Barkley said. “Now, they need and LeBron\nand Joel to play well but if they’re going to win a championship Maxey has\nto keep doing what he’s done the last three years and Jaylen has to play the\nway he did last year.\n\n「76人裡面最好的球員是Maxey跟杰倫，而LBJ會擔任組織者的角色，但是他們會是76人\n\n奪冠的原因。」\n\n「他們需要LBJ跟鉛筆打出好表現，但是76人要拿冠，Maxey就得持續做到跟過去三年一\n\n樣的表現，杰倫也要打出像他去年那樣的籃球。」\n\n“I think when I watched that game last night. I think in the beginning\nTyrese was kind of deferring instead of hell no play like you always play.\nLike a wild man with your hair on fire.\n\n「我昨天看那場比賽，我認為Maxey有點太客氣，而不是照他平常那樣打，應該要打的\n\n像火燒頭髮一樣毫無保留。」\n\n“They can’t defer to LeBron or Joel. Maxey and Brown they’re the two best\nplayers on the team. They have to go out and do their thing and LeBron and\nJoel they’re going have to fit in where they fit in.”\n\n「他們不能禮讓LBJ或鉛筆。Maxey跟杰倫是隊上最好的兩位球員，他們上場得要做到\n\n他們該做的，而LBJ及鉛筆得要去找到適合他們的定位。」\n\n----\n\n老巴